However, the endorsement of the campaign by Edrik Halbridge—a respected banker and recently retired Commonwealth Bank President credited with ending hyperinflation—has done much to calm the business community. Under government pressure, the Commonwealth Bank is ultimately coerced into backing the plan, though not without forcing another 20% cut in funding.